<title>CHINA: MERRILL LYNCH SETS WARRANTS ON UTILITIES BASKET.</title>
<headline>MERRILL LYNCH SETS WARRANTS ON UTILITIES BASKET.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Thursday it launched 1.3 billion American style call warrants on a basket of utilities stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Beijing Datang Power Generation Co Ltd  0.2  shrs</p>
<p> Hongkong Telecommunications Ltd	   0.04 shrs</p>
<p> Hong Kong and China Gas Co Ltd	    0.04 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$2.272	PREMIUM	  21.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.0638     GEARING	  3.75x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	14.AUG.97     MIN EXER LOT   20,000</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 08.JUN.98     LISTING	  HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$2.392	PAYDATE	  03.SEPT.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW    HONG KONG     LISTING DATE   04.SEPT.97</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
